<title>UK: Estates &amp; General buys property portfolio.</title>
<headline>Estates &amp; General buys property portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estates &amp; General Plc said on Thursday it had agreed to buy a property portfolio from the Northern Foods Pension Fund for 9.5 million stg.</p>
<p>The property company will pay 7.9 million in cash and the balance in new ordinary shares for the portfolio, which is predominantly retail properties located throughout England.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
